# Index files every session appends a line to: a rebase keeps both sides'
# new lines instead of stopping on a conflict (2026-10-20: gotchas and
# decisions README conflicts cost several requeues a day). Only for
# append-only indexes; a real edit of the same line would keep both
# versions, which review and TestDecisionNumbersUnique catch.
knowledgebase/*/README.md merge=union
